WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.690
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.500
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.550
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.690
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.160
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.590
I trust you forever

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.090
Now, everyone.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.970
Morning has arrived on this,
the day of the Battle Royale...

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.810
...the final event
of the Gundam Fight Finals...

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:03.720
...held once every four years
to determine the world's destiny.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:06.980
However, a peculiar atmosphere...

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.690
...surrounds the ring
that awaits them at Lantau Island.

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:13.790
Let's hope it's nothing
to be concerned about.

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:16.530
Who will survive this battle...

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:21.740
...and be crowned the ultimate fighter,
"The Gundam of Gundams"?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:25.330
Here we go to Lantau Island!

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:29.350
The Gundam Fight Final Event!
Ready! Go!

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:35.960
Battle Royale Begins!
Devil Gundam Revived

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.260
<i>Listen</i>.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.880
<i>Stop thinking only about</i>
<i>what's right under your nose</i>.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.140
<i>Look into the distance</i>.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.470
I taught you before.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.140
If you can believe in someone,
there's nothing to fear.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:49.890
Are you...?

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.310
Is your true identity...?!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.080
Domon...

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:02.740
Well done.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:04.950
Kyoji...

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.080
Kyoji!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.080
Kyoji!

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.620
Kyoji! Kyoji!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.250
You must let me see my broth...
Schwarz!

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.420
We cannot allow any visitors yet.

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:22.220
Please leave.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.470
But he might be my brother.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.180
I haven't got time for this!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:32.140
We have orders to shoot anyone
who tries to get close to Schwarz.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:33.900
Domon.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.610
Let's leave it for now.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:36.520
But...

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:39.110
Don't worry, I have a plan.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.280
Rain, what do you have in mind?

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.990
Don't tell me you've forgotten
my real profession.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.710
A doctor...!

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:53.960
That's right.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.380
I shouldn't have any problem
getting past security.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.750
Do it, Rain!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.340
See how Schwarz is doing,
and find out who he really is!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.800
Find out whether or not
he is my brother.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.720
All right, leave it to me.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.140
It's time.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.730
Please, Domon.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:28.370
Promise me that you will return alive.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.830
Otherwise, I can't let you
go into battle.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.000
I don't want you to go.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.080
Yeah.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.460
Rain.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:42.760
When we're finished fighting,
I need to tell you something.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.300
I'll be sure to win!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.970
So await my return.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.100
I'll be on my way.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.200
Look after my brother.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:00.570
Or rather, Schwarz.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:05.610
Domon...

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.620
<i>Everybody, take a look at the crowds!</i>

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.580
<i>Here on Earth</i>
<i>and in the space colonies</i>...

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:24.050
...<i>people are tuning in for the start</i>
<i>of the Gundam Fight final event</i>...

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:27.080
...<i>the Battle Royale!</i>

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.600
<i>Which Fighter will become champion?</i>

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:35.770
<i>Which nation will earn the right to rule</i>
<i>the universe for the next four years?</i>

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.390
<i>The anticipation and anxiety</i>
<i>around the world</i>...

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:41.480
...<i>is directed at the finals ring</i>
<i>Lantau Island</i>.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:51.370
Can you hear that cheering,
Devil Gundam?

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:54.790
The clowns haven't bothered
to look under their own noses.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.250
They just keep on shouting.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:03.250
That cheering sounds like voices
celebrating your full recovery!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.710
And once you have completed
your resurrection...

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:10.340
...my past effort to battle
thus far will finally be rewarded.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:17.060
No. I don't care even if I don't
personally benefit from it.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.390
I just don't want things to remain...!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.480
I cannot let things remain...!

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.780
Master East.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:31.280
You may dream, but you must realize
Devil Gundam belongs to me.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:32.280
Yes...

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.240
With the help of this young lady.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:39.960
<i>Now!</i>

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:40.960
<i>Take a look!</i>

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.830
<i>Below us is the location</i>
<i>of the Battle Royale battlefield</i>...

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.290
...<i>Lantau Island</i>.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.330
<i>Last-minute inspections</i>
<i>on the barrier generators</i>...

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:52.090
...<i>are being carried out</i>
<i>in preparation for the battle</i>.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.300
<i>I will outline the rules of the fight</i>.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:07:00.690
<i>It's quite simple. The island surrounded</i>
<i>by beam ropes, will serve as the ring</i>.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.770
<i>Here the Fighters will battle!</i>
<i>And battle!</i>

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:03.770
<i>And keep on battling!</i>

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:09.190
<i>They will battle unrestricted, until</i>
<i>only one Gundam is left standing!</i>

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:11.240
<i>And now!</i>

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.740
<i>Each nation's Gundam</i>
<i>has started to arrive!</i>

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.410
<i>First, the Gundam that has made it</i>
<i>thus far without a loss</i>.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.420
<i>The undefeated God Gundam!</i>

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:23.610
That's right.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:27.250
I've made it through my matches
in order to make it here today!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:31.970
Schwarz... Rain... Dad...!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:34.010
Watch me!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.720
I will become champion!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.350
Get 'em, Domon!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.810
God Gundam!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.560
<i>And next in line</i>...

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.940
...<i>the wild dragon from Neo China,</i>
<i>Dragon Gundam!</i>

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.990
Heaven and Earth look deserted
and motionless!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.360
Yet rarely do the spirits cease to move!

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:57.080
Z uisen, Keiun, are you ready?!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:02.160
Fight at will, and the road
shall appear before you.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:06.080
We're prepared to honor your death,
should it come to that.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.340
Well put!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:10.300
This is one battle
you've gotta risk your life for!

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.970
<i>Now, next is a fighter we all know!</i>

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.180
<i>Gundam Maxter!</i>

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.640
Janet! Cath! Bunny! Shirley!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.520
Just watch me.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:24.980
This is no dream.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.110
I will become "The Big One"!

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.800
Mademoiselle Maria Louise.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:36.410
I, George, pledge that
I will give everything...

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:40.280
...to attain the honor
of victory for my nation.

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.540
My thoughts will be with you.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.420
I am honored to hear your kind words.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:47.740
I shall be on my way.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:57.720
<i>Making a majestic appearance</i>
<i>is Gundam Rose!</i>

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:58.890
<i>And over there</i>...<i>!</i>

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:03.100
<i>Not to be left behind is Bolt Gundam!</i>

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.100
Go, Argo Gulskii!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.560
Bring us victory!

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.900
I'll do it for myself, my friends,
and you, Nastasha!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.690
<i>More Gundams arrive</i>.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:16.860
<i>Cobra Gundam, Zeus Gundam,</i>
<i>Jester Gundam</i>...

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.110
<i>And finally</i>...

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.710
...<i>Neros Gundam and John Bull Gundam!</i>

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.790
<i>Last but not least, we introduce</i>
<i>our experienced Fighter</i>...

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:34.300
...<i>and defending champion</i>
<i>from the previous Gundam Fight!</i>

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:43.930
<i>This is Master Gundam,</i>
<i>who brought victory to Neo Hong Kong!</i>

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.810
Undefeated of the East!

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.190
Domon!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.900
I commend you on winning
your matches to make it this far!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.980
But the true battle has only just begun!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.490
I've been looking forward to this,
Undefeated of the East!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:01.240
My battles were mere hurdles, so I
could defeat you and Devil Gundam!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:02.990
Beware!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.460
You're running away?!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.580
Calm down, Domon!

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.920
There's plenty of time to fight!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.880
I'll permit you to live until then.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.830
Wait!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.350
Allenby?

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.270
What the...

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.350
Attention, Gundam warriors!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.060
Welcome to Lantau Island!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:34.320
I congratulate you all on winning
your battles to make it this far.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:38.650
Those battles were but obstacles,
leading to this one final battle.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:44.280
We shall observe who will emerge
as "The Gundam of Gundams".

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.330
Now, on to the final match.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.120
The Lantau Island Battle Royale!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.870
The Gundam Fight!

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.380
Ready!

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.630
Go!

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:08.100
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:16.320
<i>The bell to start the 13th Gundam Fight</i>
<i>Final Battle Royale has rung!</i>

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.990
<i>Muzzle flashes are already visible</i>
<i>where the fighting is fierce!</i>

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:23.990
Here I come, mister!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:25.370
Come on!

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.120
We may be members
of the Shuffle Alliance...

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:35.500
...but that takes a backseat
until Devil Gundam shows up!

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:39.630
Until then, this fight is personal!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.390
Right now!

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:43.840
I'll take ya on!

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:47.100
<i>Right off the bat, we have a battle</i>
<i>between two favorites!</i>

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.310
<i>In the meantime</i>...

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.430
Rose Hurricane!

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:59.190
Then, here's my
Bursting Machinegun Punch!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.700
George, don't expect
any sympathy from me!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.040
Same here!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.790
As representatives for our nations...

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.000
...we'll fight!

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:16.920
<i>As you can see</i>...

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.210
...<i>Gundams descending onto</i>
<i>different parts of the island</i>...

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:23.590
...<i>have begun to fight against</i>
<i>the first enemy encountered</i>.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:24.930
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.640
<i>Someone is challenging</i>
<i>God Gundam to a Fight!!</i>

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:33.270
Z eus Gundam!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.310
I won't fail to defeat you this time!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.480
Not him again!

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.450
Fight! Continue fighting!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.870
Squeeze out all the strength
you store within...

00:12:56.170 --> 00:13:01.090
...and offer every drop
of your sweat to Devil Gundam!

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:11.600
Marcelot!

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.930
I haven't got time to play with you!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.640
How dare you!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.940
My one and only goal is to crush
Undefeated of the East!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:23.690
God Slash!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.700
We've lost our signal from Z eus Gundam!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:35.710
Don't hate me for this.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.370
Don't move an inch!

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:13.620
I'm doing the regular checkup.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:15.960
Beg your pardon!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:22.840
I'm certain he was brought
to that room.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:25.670
But why all this security?

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:36.560
I'm very glad that you could make it.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.310
I realize it's all very sudden.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.270
Over here, Doctor.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.480
Father!

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:49.950
I'm terribly sorry to have to ask
for assistance from Neo Japan.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:57.750
We need your opinion,
as an authority on cybernetics.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.120
Well, I certainly hope I can be of help.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.170
Show him.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.080
Yes, sir.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:13.930
What the...

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:17.850
No!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:22.710
Well, what do you think?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.150
An android.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.150
This patient is an android.

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.150
Yes.

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:33.500
Schwarz Bruder has been a masked
Fighter since his first appearance.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.990
However, the committee had confirmation
that he was human.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:40.710
At some point he must've become an android.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:44.170
I cannot even begin to fathom
how this came to be.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:48.050
Had you ever seen his face
beneath his mask?

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.880
No, this is the first time.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.030
This is like a nightmare.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.760
What's going on here?

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:59.850
Schwarz is an android
made of DG cells?

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.120
And why does he look identical to Kyoji?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.700
That's strange.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.820
What's with this silence?

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:18.160
What's that?!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:29.250
Romario's Jester Gundam!

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.460
Sijiema's Cobra Gundam!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:33.650
This is terrible.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:36.410
There should be no need
to trash them this badly.

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:37.430
Who could be...?

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:38.930
What?!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:41.520
That sound.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.400
I'm positive!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.480
But it makes no sense!

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.230
Z eus Gundam!

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:54.700
I just defeated you a moment ago!

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.050
What's going on?!

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:13.220
He's way more powerful
all of a sudden.

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.010
Could this be...?!

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.180
You've been contaminated by DG cells!

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.600
Marcelot!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.750
No mistake!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.080
This power comes from DG cells!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.420
But how?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.500
Why don't I tell you how?

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:57.840
Show yourself, my enchanting
Devil Gundam!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:10.810
What is it?

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.070
What's going on?

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.070
This isn't good!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.360
Hoy! Ming!

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.900
Get inside!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.790
What's this? What?!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.170
No way!

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.990
I can handle these waves!

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:51.400
I am an expert, after all!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.150
What the heck is that?

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.220
Devil Gundam!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.100
What is it?

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:31.890
An earthquake?

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.040
Oh, no!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.770
Switch over to our backup system!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.570
Dr. Mikamura.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:38.620
Excuse us a moment!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.530
What a surprise.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.460
Who'd have thought you'd still be alive,
and in this state?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.420
It's hard to believe.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:00.590
Long time no see, Dr. Mikamura.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.300
So you are...

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:04.790
Yes.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.010
It's me.

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:11.270
I'm Kyoji. The son of Dr. Kasshu,
your former best friend.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:17.570
What in the world's going on?

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.280
What's going on?!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:23.490
So this is what Schwarz meant
when he warned me of the island!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.500
And look at how much Devil Gundam
has already recovered!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.210
Domon!

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:35.830
I've been waiting for you!

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.420
Undefeated of the East!

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:40.630
Yes! I've been waiting for this day!

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:44.260
For the day when I, with
my recovered Devil Gundam...

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:48.100
...and you, Domon,
would meet once again!

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.470
Come, Domon!

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:52.810
Come here if you wish to fight me!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:55.310
After you defeat these others, that is!

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.820
John Bull Gundam and Neros Gundam!

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.070
You freaks!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:13.660
You've got great spirit
but you'll need to deal with him first.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.170
I thought I told you, Z eus Gundam!

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:22.590
I haven't got time to play with you!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.020
Erupting...

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:30.390
...God Finger!

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:39.310
Undefeated of the East!
Master Asia!

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:45.490
This hand of mine burns red!

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:49.160
Its bright cry tells me to defeat you!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.040
Then come, Domon Kasshu,
King of Hearts!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:59.110
If you think you can defeat...

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:03.730
...one of the Four Kings of the Devil
Gundams, Sword Raven Gundam!

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:10.760
Why this is...!

00:22:12.950 --> 00:22:16.560
So that was you, after all,
Michelo Chariot!

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:28.320
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.820
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.670
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:43.800
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:54.180
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.430 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:09.860
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:17.330
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:26.170
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.930
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:37.970
The truth about the Devil Gundam
incident is uncovered!

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:42.670
Domon struggles against Michelo,
who has the powers of Darkness!

00:23:42.670 --> 00:23:46.190
Sai Sici and Argo come to the rescue...

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:49.070
...and accomplish their mission
as members of the Shuffle Alliance!

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:51.200
Next, on Mobile Fighter G-Gundam...

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:55.780
Assault of the four evil kings!
Gundam Heaven's Sword.

00:23:54.370 --> 00:24:00.980
Assault of the Four Evil Kings!
Gundam Heaven's Sword

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:58.290
Ready! Go!
